{
  "title": "Salawat of immense rewards",
  "code": "012",
  "data": "Twenty-first: In reliable books, it is recorded that whoever invokes blessings upon the Holy Prophet and his Household by repeating the following invocation three times in the morning and three times in the evening, his sins will be forgiven, his pleasure will be kept on, his prayers will be responded, his sustenance will be expanded, he will be supported against his enemies, and he will accompany the Holy Prophet in the gardens of Paradise:\nاَللّٰهُمَّ صَلِّ عَلٰى مُحَمَّدٍ وَّ اٰلِ مُحَمَّدٍ فِى الْاَوَّلِيْنَ وَ صَلِّ عَلٰى مُحَمَّدٍ وَّ اٰلِ مُحَمَّدٍ فِى الْاٰخِرِيْنَ وَ صَلِّ عَلٰى مُحَمَّدٍ وَّ اٰلِ مُحَمَّدٍ فِى الْمَلَاۤءِ الْاَعْلٰى وَ صَلِّ عَلٰى مُحَمَّدٍ وَّ اٰلِ مُحَمَّدٍ فِى الْمُرْسَلِيْنَ اَللّٰهُمَّ اَعْطِ مُحَمَّدًا الْوَسِيْلَةَ وَ الشَّرَفَ وَالْفَضِيْلَةَ وَالدَّرَجَةَ الْكَبِيْرَةَ اللّٰهُمَّ اِنِّىْ اٰمَنْتُ بِمُحَمَّدٍ وَّ اٰلِهٖ وَ لَمْ اَرَهٗ فَلَا تَحْرِمْنِىْ يَوْمَ الْقِيَامَةِ رُؤْيَتَهٗ وَارْزُقْنِىْ صُحْبَتَهٗ وَ تَوَفَّنِىْ عَلٰى مِلَّتِهٖ وَاسْقِنِىْ مِنْ حَوْضِهٖ مَشْرَبًا رَوِيًّا ساۤئِغًا هَنِيْئًا لَّا اَظْمَاۤءُ بَعْدَهٗ اَبَدًا اِنَّكَ عَلٰى كُلِّ شَىْءٍ قَدِيْرٌ اَللّٰهُمَّ كَمَا اۤمَنْتُ بِمُحَمَّدٍ صَلَّى اللّٰهُ عَلَيْهِ وَ اٰلِهٖ وَ لَمْ اَرَهٗ فَاَرِنِىْ فِى الْجِنَانِ وَجْهَهٗ اَللّٰهُمَّ بَلِّغْ رُوْحَ مُحَمَّدٍ عَنِّىْ تَحِيَّةً كَثِيْرَةً وَ سَلَامًا.\nAALLAAHUMA SALI A'ALAAAA MUHAMADIN WA AAALI MUHAMADIN FIAA ALAAWALIYNA WA SALI A'ALAAAA MUHAMADIN WA AAALI MUHAMADIN FIAA ALAAAKHIRIYNA WA SALI A'ALAAAA MUHAMADIN WA AAALI MUHAMADIN FIAA ALMALAA'I ALAAA'LAAAA WA SALI A'ALAAAA MUHAMADIN WA AAALI MUHAMADIN FIAA ALMURSALIYNA AALLAAHUMA AAA'TI MUHAMADANA ALWASIYLAHA WA ALSHARAFA WAALFADIYLAHA WAALDARAJAHA ALKABIYRAHA UMA AINIAA AAAMANTU BIMUHAMADIN WA AAALIHEE WA LAM AARAHU FALAA TAHRIMNIAA YAWMA ALQIYAAMAHI RU'YATAHU WAARZUQNIAA SUHBATAHU WA TAWAFANIAA A'ALAAAA MILATIHEE WAASQINIAA MIN HAWDIHEE MASHRABANA RAWIYANA SA'IGHANA HANIY'ANA LAA AAZMAA'U BAA'DAHU AABADANA AINAKA A'ALAAAA KULI SHAAA'IN QADIYRUN AALLAAHUMA KAMAA AMANTU BIMUHAMADIN SALAAA U A'ALAYHI WA AAALIHEE WA LAM AARAHU FAAARINIAA FIAA ALJINAANI WAJHAHU AALLAAHUMA BALIGH RUWHA MUHAMADIN A'ANIAA TAHIYAHAN KATHIYRAHAN WA SALAAMANA.\nMay Allah accept this supplication."
